Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban sync: move heal_clobbered_completions beside
 its sibling heal (file-size cap)

Main grew kanban_sync_client.py to 1999 lines, so this PR's growth crossed the
2000-line target. The completion heal and its placeholder constant move
unchanged into kanban_sync_divergence.py next to heal_running_over_ended_run;
the round imports both from there and the two tests that touched it follow.
